# TOEFL Vocabulary Day58

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| photosynthesis | 광합성 | Photosynthesis requires sunlight. |
| absorb | 흡수하다 | Plants absorb water through their roots. |
| moisture | 수분 | The soil contains little moisture. |
| drought | 가뭄 | Plants may suffer during a drought. |
| survive | 생존하다 | Some plants can survive in dry environments. |
| adapt | 적응하다 | Plants adapt to local conditions. |
| root | 뿌리 | Deep roots help plants obtain water. |
| surface | 표면 | Water evaporates from the surface. |

### 암기 포인트

- photosynthesis: 광합성
- absorb water: 물을 흡수하다
- soil moisture: 토양 수분
- severe drought: 심각한 가뭄
- survive in dry conditions: 건조한 환경에서 생존하다
- deep roots: 깊은 뿌리
